{"theory":"w3-5-6-c","chiral_algebra":"\\mathcal{W}_3(5,6)^{C}","Z_tex":"Z = \\tfrac12\\big(Z_{1,1}+Z_{1,C}+Z_{C,1}+Z_{C,C}\\big) = \\sum_{C\\text{-orbits}} |\\chi_{(\\lambda;\\mu)}|^2 + \\sum_{\\text{fixed}}\\big(|\\chi^+|^2+|\\chi^-|^2\\big) + \\sum_r \\big(|\\mathcal{T}^+_r|^2+|\\mathcal{T}^-_r|^2\\big)","character_tex":"Frenkel-Kac-Wakimoto characters $\\chi_{(\\lambda;\\mu)} = \\eta(\\tau)^{-2}\\sum_{w\\in W(A_2)}\\epsilon(w)\\sum_{\\alpha\\in Q} q^{|p'(\\lambda+\\rho)-p\\,w(\\mu+\\rho)+pp'\\alpha|^2/2pp'}$, $p'=p+1$, with $\\lambda = (\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2)$ a level-$(p-3)$ and $\\mu = (\\mu_1,\\mu_2)$ a level-$(p-2)$ $SU(3)$ weight in Dynkin labels, $(\\lambda;\\mu)\\sim(\\sigma\\lambda;\\sigma\\mu)$ under the $\\mathbb{Z}_3$ rotation of affine Dynkin labels; $h = \\frac{|p'(\\lambda+\\rho)-p(\\mu+\\rho)|^2-|\\rho|^2}{2pp'}$. On a self-conjugate field ($\\lambda+\\rho = a\\rho$, $\\mu+\\rho = b\\rho$) the $C$-twined character is $t_{a,b} = \\eta(2\\tau)^{-1}\\sum_{n\\in\\mathbb{Z}}\\big(q^{(p'a-pb+pp'n)^2/pp'}-q^{(p'a+pb+pp'n)^2/pp'}\\big)$ and $\\chi^{\\pm} = \\frac12(\\chi\\pm t_{a,b})$. Twisted characters (Poisson resummation of $t_{a,b}$): $\\mathcal{T}_r = \\eta(\\tau/2)^{-1}\\big(\\sum_{x\\equiv r\\ (pp')}-\\sum_{x\\equiv r^*\\ (pp')}\\big)\\,q^{x^2/4pp'}$ with $r^*\\equiv r$ mod $p$, $r^*\\equiv -r$ mod $p'$, of weight $h_r = \\frac1{16}+\\frac{r^2-4}{4pp'}$; $\\mathcal{T}^{\\pm}_r$ are its parts with $L_0-h_r$ in $\\mathbb{Z}$ and $\\mathbb{Z}+\\frac12$. Here $p = 5$ and $(r,r^*) \\in \\{(1,11), (2,22), (4,14), (7,17)\\}$.","description":"Orbifold of $\\mathcal{W}_3(5,6)$ by charge conjugation $C: W\\to -W$, $(\\lambda;\\mu)\\mapsto(\\lambda^*;\\mu^*)$ (Dijkgraaf-Vafa-Verlinde-Verlinde 1989). The untwisted sector keeps one copy of each $C$-orbit of terms and the $C$-even parts of the 4 terms on self-conjugate fields ($C = +1$ on their primaries, the only choice whose twisted sector has non-negative integer multiplicities and spins in $\\frac12\\mathbb{Z}$); the twisted sector $\\sum_r|\\mathcal{T}_r|^2$ is the Poisson resummation of $Z_{1,C} = \\sum|t_{a,b}|^2$, projected to integer spin.","generator":"scripts/spectra/gen_w3.py","c":"6/5","irreducible":true,"cutoff":"8","s_error":2.9e-16,"gap":"3/40","blocks":[{"label":"\\chi_{(0,0;0,0)}^{+}","h":"0","coeffs":[1,0,1,1,2,2,5,5,10]},{"label":"\\chi_{(0,0;0,0)}^{-}","h":"3","coeffs":[1,1,2,3,5,7]},{"label":"\\chi_{(0,1;0,1)}","h":"2/45","coeffs":[1,1,3,5,9,14,23,35,54]},{"label":"\\chi_{(1,1;1,1)}^{+}","h":"1/10","coeffs":[1,1,2,4,7,11,18,27,42]},{"label":"\\chi_{(1,1;1,1)}^{-}","h":"11/10","coeffs":[1,2,4,6,11,17,27,40]},{"label":"\\chi_{(0,0;0,1)}","h":"1/9","coeffs":[1,1,2,3,6,9,15,22,35]},{"label":"\\chi_{(0,1;1,0)}","h":"17/45","coeffs":[1,2,3,6,10,17,26,41,61]},{"label":"\\chi_{(0,0;1,1)}^{+}","h":"1/2","coeffs":[1,1,2,3,6,8,14,20,31]},{"label":"\\chi_{(0,0;1,1)}^{-}","h":"3/2","coeffs":[1,1,3,4,8,12,20,28]},{"label":"\\chi_{(0,1;0,0)}","h":"3/5","coeffs":[1,1,2,3,6,9,15,22,34]},{"label":"\\chi_{(1,1;0,1)}","h":"32/45","coeffs":[1,2,4,7,12,19,31,46,70]},{"label":"\\chi_{(0,0;0,2)}","h":"7/9","coeffs":[1,1,3,4,8,12,20,29,45]},{"label":"\\chi_{(2,0;0,1)}","h":"13/9","coeffs":[1,2,4,6,11,16,26,38]},{"label":"\\chi_{(1,1;0,0)}^{+}","h":"8/5","coeffs":[1,1,2,3,5,7,12,17]},{"label":"\\chi_{(1,1;0,0)}^{-}","h":"13/5","coeffs":[1,1,3,4,7,10,17]},{"label":"\\chi_{(2,0;0,0)}","h":"2","coeffs":[1,1,3,4,7,10,17]},{"label":"\\mathcal{T}_{1}^{+}","h":"3/80","coeffs":[1,1,3,5,9,15,24,37,57]},{"label":"\\mathcal{T}_{1}^{-}","h":"43/80","coeffs":[1,2,4,7,12,19,30,46,69]},{"label":"\\mathcal{T}_{2}^{+}","h":"1/16","coeffs":[1,1,2,4,6,10,16,24,36]},{"label":"\\mathcal{T}_{2}^{-}","h":"25/16","coeffs":[1,2,4,7,11,18,28,42]},{"label":"\\mathcal{T}_{4}^{+}","h":"13/80","coeffs":[1,2,3,6,10,16,26,40,60]},{"label":"\\mathcal{T}_{4}^{-}","h":"53/80","coeffs":[1,2,4,7,12,20,31,48,72]},{"label":"\\mathcal{T}_{7}^{+}","h":"7/16","coeffs":[1,1,2,4,7,11,18,27,41]},{"label":"\\mathcal{T}_{